    "Secondary whole-source comparison has 12 supported/supported matches; among model-supported claims, 3 are locked partial and 1 ambiguous. It does not replace the primary citation-bound comparison.",
    "All three recorded model coverage values are sufficient while all three fixed core-sufficiency judgments are insufficient. This records an adequacy-assessment discrepancy under the frozen criteria, not a new judgment.",
    "The cross-tabs are descriptive agreement/disagreement counts for three supplied final alignment candidates. They are not accuracy, precision, recall, calibration or human-validated error rates.",
    "No model rejection cause, internal rationale, operational acceptance or runtime failure is inferred from these verdicts. The packet records claim verdicts and coverage, not the model internal reasoning."
